            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "روی سنگ یک کتیبه قدیمی بود. Ru-ye sang yek katibe-ye qadimi bud. There was an old inscription on the stone."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Carved on stone or set in tiles on a building."
            }
